            },
            "message": "<div class=\"upload-instructions\">\r\n\r\n<b>Recommended Size:<\/b> Minimum 314px by 322px (Regular Display) - Maximum 470px by 483px (Retina Display) - (width x height)<br \/>\r\n\r\n<b>Image Height:<\/b> Height of the image can vary slightly due to aspect ratio, but width of image must meet the recommended size.<br \/>\r\n\r\n<b>Resources:<\/b> Make sure to upload a compressed image in <i>.WEBP<\/i> image format. - <a href=\"https:\/\/image.online-convert.com\/convert-to-webp\" target=\"_blank\">Convert Images to WEBP<\/a> - <a href=\"https:\/\/tinypng.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Compress WEBP Images<\/a>\r\n\r\n<\/div>",
